The coordination layer — poll/retry/reconcile state machine, OTP supervisor
tree, Phoenix Channels broadcast idioms, and failure-mode taxonomy — is lifted
from Symphony's orchestrator.ex and adapted for Shuttle's integration layer.

The integration layer (Linear adapter → felt CLI; codex-app-server → tmux +
agent CLI wrappers; WORKFLOW.md → fiber-frontmatter shuttle: block) is original
work by Cail Daley.

